From 11be7e2e3d550e6d7c3db6551d8a97a828e1efba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:06:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: finish the DPU encoder
 cleanup, fix the grey panel

Kernel patches 0146-0147 are patches 2 and 3 of Xi Zhang's DPU resource cleanup series. Add patches 1 and 4 as 0161-0162: reset unassigned resource slots to NULL on a topology update, and undo the dither setup the way it was set up. Add 0163, which pairs DSC blocks only with the pingpong of their index on SM8250, so the phone panel no longer stays grey on the first switch back from DisplayPort after a boot with the monitor attached. Advance to release 91.
---
